{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of eight classes, such as <strong>Fire Mage</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a pair of <strong>Stomping Boots</strong> and squish your enemies to death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move statues</strong> around for some reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch a <strong>Yellow Butterfly</strong> and run really fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are a few more things you can do in Zimmer</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice at an altar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink from a fountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break almost any object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go shopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal from a shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub a magic lamp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine some gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your armor at an anvil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure monsters onto traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a deer in your pocket for emergency use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your enemies into stone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on a dart trap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit by a dart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on it again, dodge the darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get an Amulet of Explosive Darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosive darts for fun and profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow yourself up with your own explosion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a room with three doors. Two doors lead to traps and monsters, the third door will contain a room with a treasure and three more doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action roguelike, heavily inspired by classic games such as nethack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely procedurally generated, no two runs will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ascend in less than an hour, depending on how fast you play, it could be much shorter or longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels, or endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 starting classes with random stats and buffs/debuffs (plus a 9th secret class)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of traps and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 song chiptune soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique monsters and items during December and October.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sometimes you have to roll the hard six","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/ada55d678a01e204e230090935c398a5782c0f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Rodents of Unusual Size","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/ee29a9b4f7aa837f3f091eec58e39bc78d606464.jpg"},{"name":"Why Did It Have to Be Snakes?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/52bd7aab4d43f99344fb5f066f63bf3fed05ff8a.jpg"},{"name":"Unfriendly Neighborhood Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/4cc5c9b52df7d2961c63f3bcf05c4c38a15c87e6.jpg"},{"name":"An evil thing in spider-form","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/7a3d3301fa067c3c9e4004eb08974a4e860a5bee.jpg"},{"name":"We can't stop here. This is bat country.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/620eea3b633d868c4e848bd5627852b4a0acc9bd.jpg"},{"name":"Snakes in a game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/27e5548ddec0021f9d2c95db80e89352c350f87a.jpg"},{"name":"If I was in World War II they'd call me spitfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/03b62501940b80b10914814a1eafc50b590e159f.jpg"},{"name":"Hi there, this is Rusty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/fa9f3d4bc1fc1ff06bd47f1c1af4740e67aafbd6.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing hurts the blob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2127660/f6363476832a391279c5e0411e5175476b076d59.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2127660?t=1747279240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747279240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747279240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747279240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of eight classes, such as <strong>Fire Mage</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/2ad3df350b5e5874aa5ae0418e99ce52.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a pair of <strong>Stomping Boots</strong> and squish your enemies to death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/8b9b1cfab555bcfd05c7395addf66947.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move statues</strong> around for some reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/ee313bad1744d3f127ddbc32a9f72ce4.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch a <strong>Yellow Butterfly</strong> and run really fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.poster.avif?t=1747279240\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.webm?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/extras/5b77a872ba834e5a8336738f64c517ab.mp4?t=1747279240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are a few more things you can do in Zimmer</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice at an altar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink from a fountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break almost any object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go shopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal from a shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub a magic lamp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine some gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your armor at an anvil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure monsters onto traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a deer in your pocket for emergency use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your enemies into stone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on a dart trap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit by a dart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on it again, dodge the darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get an Amulet of Explosive Darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosive darts for fun and profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow yourself up with your own explosion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a room with three doors. Two doors lead to traps and monsters, the third door will contain a room with a treasure and three more doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action roguelike, heavily inspired by classic games such as nethack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely procedurally generated, no two runs will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ascend in less than an hour, depending on how fast you play, it could be much shorter or longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels, or endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 starting classes with random stats and buffs/debuffs (plus a 9th secret class)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of traps and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 song chiptune soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique monsters and items during December and October.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Spazm"],"dlc":[2155810],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127660/header.jpg?t=1747279240","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This software, all accompanying files, data and materials, are distributed \"AS IS\" and with no warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. The user must assume all risk of using the program.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCopyright 2022, all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2127660/489237/7e6f3da843fd43042906b06db14f28ee0e8a0b65/1751079537/dash_av1.mpd?t=1661276414","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2127660/489237/7e6f3da843fd43042906b06db14f28ee0e8a0b65/1751079537/dash_h264.mpd?t=1661276414","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai